\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Itemize
PINNS – Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINNs)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Physics-modification (PM) methods improve accuracy by modifying the system’s physics,
 such as adding artificial viscosity or enforcing entropy constraints.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Loss and training modification (LM) techniques focus on regularizing the loss landscape,
 often by refining the loss term in high-error regions.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
Architecture-modification (AM) propose advanced network designs to handle discontinuities better.
 
\end_layout

